docs {
  `POST /v1/penalties/:id/cancel`

  Cancels a penalty.

  - **Auth:** Bearer access token (`{{accessToken}}`, set by `auth/Login`)
  - **Capabilities:** `hr:manage_payroll`
  - **Listeners:** internal
  - **Success:** `200`; `data` has `id`, `status`, `remainingThb`
}
